               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### KINKIN\n\nKINKIN is the \"equivalence movement.\" It applies when multiple circles sit in the first square and their sum equals another square in the same line, so the circles merge into that square.\n\n1 + 1 = 2 + 0\n\nUse the green arrow to perform this movement and update the fingers. Use the blue arrow to return to the original position.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
